  "instance_name": "mapping_1",
  "label": "The man is mapped as the frustrated meme creator",
  "description": "The text 'i don't need you to tell me how fuckin good my memes are...' and 'i get reported all the fuckin time' explicitly refer to the speaker's identity as the creator of memes who is being reported. The visual material of the man pointing aggressively with a frustrated expression is mapped onto this textual self-reference. The man's demeanor and gesture visually embody the frustration and defensiveness described in the text, creating an analogical mapping where the person in the image is the 'me' in the text.",
